{"sba-keyaki-9862":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいりさがとってくれた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4DZ6WYHZNPPFYM9V4JT7R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で買いました。☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりお店に並んでるのみると嬉しいですね。☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4E0XYYKT5XPMV5PAW3GZD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ本当に可愛かった…。こんな色味のある洋服なんて全然きないから。自分でも挑戦してみよう。☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☺︎"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9440":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イケメンの生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑個別握手会の時の服だよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前は京都にて全国握手会がありましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野七瀬ちゃんと同じだったんだぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあちゃんファンの皆様まあやと握手してくれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえたでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも優しいまあや族の皆様\n会いに来てくれてありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも遠くから早い時間に来てくれて\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方やブログ名と顔が一致して嬉しかったり♪\nとっても楽しかったです♪\n楽しんでもらえたかな〜？\n楽しい二日間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった方もいつもブログで応援してくれるからパワーが湧いてきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんは『どいやさん』についてめっちゃ語ってくれたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その１\nあのキャラクターは触ると低反発だそうです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その２\nお風呂は必ず一番風呂に入るそうです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば...\nメイクしてもらってたらメイクさんのメイク道具にどいやさんの絵が書いてあって...なぁちゃん絵上手いなぁって思いながらいつも見てるよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋ではワイワイして遊んだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんが光と鏡を使ってまあやの顔照してきたり(結構眩しい笑)、口にアミアミ、ちはるんの三人でラクガキしたり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんが、今度また握手会一緒になりたいね♪って言ってくれたから嬉しかった〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでね、この前レッスン中まいやんとななみんにホッペにチューされた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の東京Zeppライブではトマトちゃんにチューされた......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のライブはみんなすごい沢山練習してつくりあげたから達成感半端ないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年の締めくくりだったし、会場も満員でギュウギュウで、今までのこと思い出すとなんか心がギュッとしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援聞こえました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サプライズ発表もあり、沢山乃木坂familyの方達と盛り上がれて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに素敵な１年にしてもらえて\n１年を大好きな人達といれて本当に"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！♪\n京都の全国握手会の日、隣に座ってたかずみんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『個別握手での、まあやレーンの人はまあやblogみたいにキラキラしてる』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってくれたんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と〜っても嬉しかったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや家さんを誉めてくれてテンション高山〜♪♪〜〜♪♪\n大好きかずみん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディーPV 撮影の時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも何時に寝てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0007.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-21583":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n 夜眠くて眠くて仕方がなくて\n 15分だけ、、、\n と思ってお布団に入って、次に目を開けた時はもう朝。\n \n なんともいえない絶望感から1日がよく始まります。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n 幕張での個別握手会ありがとうございました！\n \n 遅い時間なのに沢山の方が来て下さりました。\n \n 私のことを気遣ってくれたり、\n たくさん笑わせてくれたり、\n 皆さん本当に優しいし楽しいですー(o^^o)\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0VQ9RC9JFM0SJSXJ3PG9PN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 大人めハーフツイン(・ω・)ノ\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0VQANQSWPNZY7NKF2FPMZN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 袖がお気に入りのニットを着ました！！\n \n \n また全身撮るの忘れましたごめんなさい(T . T)\n \n \n \n そして、としちゃんと（加藤史帆）と\n みーぱん（佐々木美玲）の生誕祭で\n 花束担当しました！！\n \n \n 更にとしちゃんの生誕祭では\n 乃木坂46の秋元真夏さんのお手紙を代読する\n という大役も務めさせていただきました、、、！\n \n 今年1緊張しました。震えた〜〜\n \n \n \n \n 二人とも改めて、おめでとう( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0VQBNPDNT4N51DDWJNHWG6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0VQCN8RYHV331G314AF8VH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n みーぱんが最近愛おしすぎて\n 愛を込めてぱぱと呼んでます。\n \n ぱぱ～\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0VQDN088P5BBAAK73XYG80","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0VQEMWXTMG7M8KVVTD2MFR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0VQG9NCC98D55RV2WNV59Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 素敵なお花をいつもいつも\n ありがとうございます（；＿；）♡\n \n 幸せマックス\n \n \n ではまたね(　˙-˙　)/\n \n 佐々木美玲\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n じゃなかった\n \n \n 佐々木久美でした(・ω・)ノ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-19288":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、七夕だったんだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4日にかなメルの方に七夕の話書いたけど\nそれから日が経って忘れてた～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年、願い叶うかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達が七夕はガチだと言っていたから\n叶うと信じてる`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46復活の個人ＰＶ撮影秘話を松村、中田が語る！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がアップされました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルコンビ\nさゆりんと語ってます＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PV以外のこともたっぷり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/08/3143656/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://news.dwango.jp/?itemid=8576"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/08/3143656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/07/08/3143656/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえす(・∀・)\nなんやかんやでプレミアム会員なんです(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kan